{"step_index":9972,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:43Z","thinking":"Adding configuration options for the vision API URL and model within the settings loading and saving mechanisms appears straightforward, with sensible default values. Need to examine how the `showScreen` function is being overridden, specifically focusing on the lines that handle sidebar active states.\n\n\nAnalyzing how the `showScreen` function manages screen visibility and sidebar highlighting. Observing it first calls an original function if present. Otherwise, it deactivates all screens, then activates the target screen based on its ID. The code attempts to automatically activate the corresponding sidebar navigation item. Special logic handles screen-new to show a progress modal or reset the new process form. The logs and settings screens have specific load functions as well.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":false,"Description":"Fix showScreen navigation active state synchronization and preserve loading modal","EndLine":3540,"Instruction":"Update showScreen to auto-detect sidebar nav element and preserve running state on screen-new","ReplacementContent":"        // Override showScreen to handle active states on sidebar\n        const originalShowScreen = window.showScreen;\n        window.showScreen = function(screenId, element = null) {\n            // Call original if it exists\n            if (typeof originalShowScreen === 'function') {\n                originalShowScreen(screenId);\n            } else {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));\n                const target = document.getElementById(screenId);\n                if (target) target.classList.add('active');\n            }\n            \n            // Auto-detect and sync sidebar active nav item if element is null or not provided\n            if (!element) {\n                element = document.querySelector(`.nav-menu .nav-item[onclick*=\"${screenId}\"]`);\n            }\n            if (element) {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));\n                element.classList.add('active');\n            }\n\n            // Update top bar heading\n            if (typeof updateTopBarHeading === 'function') {\n                updateTopBarHeading(screenId);\n            }\n\n            if (screenId === 'screen-new') {\n                if (typeof isProcessRunning !== 'undefined' && isProcessRunning) {\n                    const progressModal = document.getElementById('progress-modal');\n                    if (progressModal) progressModal.style.display = 'flex';\n                } else {\n                    resetNewProcessForm();\n                }\n            } else if (screenId === 'screen-logs' || screenId === 'screen-settings') {\n                loadLogs();\n            } else if (screenId === 'screen-servers') {\n                loadServersUI();\n                loadServerLogs();\n            }\n        };","StartLine":3507,"TargetContent":"        // Override showScreen to handle active states on sidebar\n        const originalShowScreen = window.showScreen;\n        window.showScreen = function(screenId, element = null) {\n            // Call original if it exists\n            if (typeof originalShowScreen === 'function') {\n                originalShowScreen(screenId);\n            } else {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.screen').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));\n                const target = document.getElementById(screenId);\n                if (target) target.classList.add('active');\n            }\n            \n            // Update sidebar active class\n            if (element) {\n                document.querySelectorAll('.nav-item').forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));\n                element.classList.add('active');\n            }\n\n            // Update top bar heading\n            if (typeof updateTopBarHeading === 'function') {\n                updateTopBarHeading(screenId);\n            }\n\n            if (screenId === 'screen-new') {\n                resetNewProcessForm();\n            } else if (screenId === 'screen-logs' || screenId === 'screen-settings') {\n                loadLogs();\n            } else if (screenId === 'screen-servers') {\n                loadServersUI();\n                loadServerLogs();\n            }\n        };","TargetFile":"d:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy-vision\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html","toolAction":"Updating showScreen in index.html","toolSummary":"Fix showScreen sidebar synchronization"}}]}
